speed: Sets the WalkSpeed of a player
jump: Sets the JumpPower of a player
fly: Toggles fly mode on yourself
noclip: Toggles noclip on yourself
invisible: Makes yourself invisible
freeze: Freezes a player in place
unfreeze: Unfreezes a player
kill: Kills a target player
respawn: Respawns a target player
tp: Teleports you to a player
bring: Brings a player to you
fling: Flings a player with velocity
sit: Forces a player to sit
god: Enables godmode on yourself
esp: Toggles player ESP
chams: Highlights all players
nametags: Shows nametags through walls
tracers: Draws lines to all players
gravity: Sets workspace gravity
timeset: Sets lighting clock time
fog: Sets fog density
ambient: Sets lighting ambient
brightness: Sets lighting brightness
players: Lists all players with info
serverid: Shows current server JobId
ping: Shows your current ping
uptime: Shows server uptime
serversize: Shows player count vs max
pm: Sends a fake whisper to a player
spam: Spams a chat message
hint: Shows a hint to all clients
reset: Respawns yourself
goto: Teleports to coordinates
pos: Prints your current position
rejoin: Rejoins the current game
spectate: Spectates a player
